If the keyboard is no plugged in, you should get video, but of course
won't be able to interact with it. If the keyboard and mouse are swapped,
then on many machine you'll get no video etc....

Since you just had the case open I'd open it up again, check everything is
seated properly, including memory etc...

Then try again.

--rdp

