ok looks like with what you're passing for arguments, the CDRom on your
PWS may be on the primary IDE controller (as you're passing dka0)

try changing hdc to hda. An even better thing to try (if you can see it
fly by) is where the kernel picks up the IDE drive. It flies by fairly
quickly, so it's kinda hard to grab...

IIRC the default for the IDE CDRoms on PWS is hdc (dkb0) but it's been a
while and I don't have direct access to one anymore.

Kurt


