SwapTotal:     2561008 kB
SwapFree:      2561008 kB

After compiling/running some code (for example, compiling up mpich and 
running a few codes), the memory will become cached.

# cat /proc/meminfo 
        total:    used:    free:  shared: buffers:  cached:
Mem:  2104926208 2100666368  4259840        0   851968 1928642560
Swap: 2622472192 594223104 2028249088
